msgstr "Mijn paspoortgegevens exporteren"

#: app/templates/passports/index.html:8
#: app/templates/passports/record_visit.html:38
msgid "Fly yourself? Keep your own pilot logbook on this account and your logged arrivals fill your passports automatically."
msgstr "Vlieg je zelf? Houd je eigen pilootlogboek bij op dit account en je gelogde aankomsten vullen je paspoorten automatisch."

#: app/templates/passports/index.html:8
#: app/templates/passports/record_visit.html:38
#: app/templates/passports/start_logbook.html:2
#: app/templates/passports/start_logbook.html:6
#: app/templates/passports/start_logbook.html:18
